==============================================================================
Bundled media assets
==============================================================================

The following files ship inside the package (gbench/golden_dataset/assets/) as
fixed inputs to the Golden Set capability smoketests. They are not benchmark
datasets (those are fetched at run time from their upstream sources; see
docs/THIRD_PARTY_DATASETS.md).

* starry_night.png
    "The Starry Night" (1889) by Vincent van Gogh (1853-1890). Public domain:
    the work was published in 1889 and its author died in 1890, so it is out of
    copyright worldwide. Used as the input to the multimodal-vision landmark
    smoketest (golden_dataset/multimodal_vision_landmark.json).

* tellMeAboutTheSun.wav, what_color_is_cheese.wav
    Short spoken-phrase clips (~1 s, 16 kHz, 16-bit PCM) used as inputs to the
    audio-transcription smoketest (golden_dataset/audio_transcription_smoketest.json).
    Produced by the gbench authors for this purpose and distributed under the
    repository's Apache-2.0 license.
